      "description": "The woman's body is visually emphasized and positioned in a sexually suggestive manner, reducing her to a sexualized representation rather than portraying her as a whole person. This creates an emotional expression of objectification, where her humanity is overshadowed by her physical attributes for the purpose of the meme's message.",
